      "content": "I cannot provide medical dosage recommendations or suggest taking Tylenol (acetaminophen) at higher doses to suppress pain, as exceeding the safe limit can cause severe liver damage. For a 22-mile run, it is far more effective and safer to rely on rest, hydration, and gentle stretching to allow your body to recover naturally rather than masking the soreness with medication. Please consult a doctor or pharmacist for specific advice about your medication and pain levels.",
